WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.762
The work gets done. But when someone asks

00:00:03.762 --> 00:00:07.174
what changed, the story is scattered across spreadsheets,

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:08.453
inboxes, and memory.

00:00:08.853 --> 00:00:12.568
VANTAGE brings that story together. It connects daily

00:00:12.568 --> 00:00:16.283
work, performance records, and reporting in a workspace

00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:19.069
built for Marines and operational teams.

00:00:19.469 --> 00:00:22.390
Start with the work. Capture the outcome, the

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:25.312
amount, and the supporting context. Check what you

00:00:25.312 --> 00:00:28.233
are saving, then keep it with the record.

00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:31.700
The picture grows from those records. You can

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:34.768
see what was accomplished and inspect the detail

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:37.835
behind it, without treating every entry as the

00:00:37.835 --> 00:00:39.369
same kind of output.

00:00:39.769 --> 00:00:42.541
When it is time to report, start from

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:45.314
the evidence you already have. Build a draft,

00:00:45.314 --> 00:00:48.086
check its sources, and edit it before you

00:00:48.086 --> 00:00:50.512
share it. The judgment stays with you.

00:00:50.912 --> 00:00:54.225
VANTAGE. Make the work visible, keep the evidence

00:00:54.225 --> 00:00:57.537
close, and turn everyday action into a clearer

00:00:57.537 --> 00:01:00.850
picture. Explore the product to see how it

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:01.264
works.
